OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners paddle River Severn
OL,4,Afor flood action
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of campaigners are canoeing and
OL,7,Fkayaking the River Severn to raise
OL,8,Fawareness of the impact of flooding.
OL,10,FStarting at Llanidloes in mid Wales on
OL,11,F1 September, the Severn Together
OL,12,Fflotilla will end its voyage in
OL,13,FBridgnorth, in Shropshire on 6
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FThe group are calling for the English
OL,17,Fand Welsh governments to commit more
OL,18,Fsupport to the Severn Valley Water
OL,19,FManagement Scheme (SVWMS), a
OL,20,Fmulti-agency organisation that aims to
OL,21,Freduce flood risks.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
