OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners paddle River Severn
OL,4,Afor flood action
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Welsh government
OL,7,Fsaid it would "continue to work closely
OL,8,Fwith partners to reduce flood risk",
OL,9,Fand the Department for Environment,
OL,10,FFood and Rural Affairs said the SVWMS
OL,11,Fhad received #14.5m from the UK
OL,12,Fgovernment.
